# An Auto space follows macOS live, both ways, in the window content and the sidebar; a Light
# space keeps its look (#155). 0.1.30-0.1.32 saved the editor's one-colour Auto as a fixed theme.
# systemAppearance flips the app's appearance without touching the Mac's own setting.
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
